### FleetDesk Booking API - VS Code REST Client
### Start everything first:  npm run demo:all   (Fleet on 3001, Booking on 3002)
### Click "Send Request" above each block, top to bottom.

@fleet = http://localhost:3001
@api = http://localhost:3002
@password = Demo-Pass-2026
@from = 2026-12-15T09:00:00Z
@to = 2026-12-15T13:00:00Z

### 1. Health check (no login) -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/health

### 2. Log in through the Fleet API (shared login)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{fleet}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@fleetdesk.test", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 3.
# @name saraLogin
POST {{fleet}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sara@fleetdesk.test", "password": "{{password}}" }

@admin = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@sara = {{saraLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. No token -> 401
GET {{api}}/api/bookings

### 5. Free cars for 2 passengers (Booking asks Fleet) -> 200
# @name search
GET {{api}}/api/bookings/availability?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&seats=2
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}

@carId = {{search.response.body.cars[0].id}}

### 6. Trip estimate (needs ORS_API_KEY, otherwise 503)
GET {{api}}/api/bookings/estimate?destination=Smart Village, Giza
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}

### 7. Request a car -> 201 Pending (try adding "status": "Approved": it is ignored)
# @name created
POST {{api}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "{{carId}}", "startAt": "{{from}}", "endAt": "{{to}}",
  "purpose": "Client meeting at Smart Village", "destination": "Smart Village, Giza", "passengers": 2 }

@bookingId = {{created.response.body.id}}

### 8. Invalid: end before start -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "{{carId}}", "startAt": "{{to}}", "endAt": "{{from}}", "purpose": "Wrong dates", "destination": "Cairo" }

### 9. Employee tries to approve -> 403
PATCH {{api}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Approved" }

### 10. Admin approves -> 200 Approved
PATCH {{api}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Approved" }

### 11. Conflicts (what Fleet calls) -> { "conflict": true }
GET {{api}}/api/bookings/conflicts?vehicleId={{carId}}&from={{from}}&to={{to}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 12. Fleet schedules maintenance in that slot -> 409 BOOKING_CLASH (Fleet asked Booking)
POST {{fleet}}/api/vehicles/{{carId}}/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Service", "startDate": "{{from}}", "endDate": "{{to}}" }

### 13. Sara's own bookings
GET {{api}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}

### 14. Sara cancels -> 200 Cancelled
PATCH {{api}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{sara}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Cancelled" }
